00:41:19,220 --> 00:41:21,660
add gold nanoparticle probes that

787
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:25,760
are specific for the anthrax genomic DNA.

788
00:41:25,860 --> 00:41:28,660
If anthrax DNA is present in any of the samples,

789
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:32,300
the tiny probes will bind to it.

790
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:37,040
The samples are put on a slide and placed into the VeriGene ID.

791
00:41:37,041 --> 00:41:40,580
Any samples containing anthrax will be indicated by bright spots

792
00:41:40,680 --> 00:41:42,480
on the screen.

793
00:41:42,580 --> 00:41:44,380
Sample one is positive for anthrax.

794
00:41:44,480 --> 00:41:45,940
Sample two is positive.

795
00:41:46,040 --> 00:41:47,780
Three, four positive.

796
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:50,280
Five, six, no anthrax.

797
00:41:50,380 --> 00:41:52,860
Seven, eight are our internal controls.

798
00:41:52,960 --> 00:41:54,400
They shouldn't light up.

799
00:41:54,500 --> 00:41:57,460
And nine, 10 are also positive.

800
00:41:57,560 --> 00:41:59,900
The first users of nanotechnology detectors

801
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:03,360
will likely be in the field of medicine.

802
00:42:03,460 --> 00:42:05,760
Having a Veritene ID system that has been tailored

803
00:42:05,761 --> 00:42:07,600
for detecting those certain types of diseases

804
00:42:07,700 --> 00:42:10,400
that might be a bio-warfare agent placed in the hospitals

805
00:42:10,500 --> 00:42:13,300
will allow them to detect it as early as possible

806
00:42:13,400 --> 00:42:15,100
and to screen out those potential patients

807
00:42:15,200 --> 00:42:16,200
that may be infected.

808
00:42:16,300 --> 00:42:19,400
The vision is to have a detection system

809
00:42:19,500 --> 00:42:22,420
in every doctor's office in the world.

810
00:42:22,520 --> 00:42:23,820
And then I like to say, ultimately,

811
00:42:23,920 --> 00:42:26,120
every medicine cabinet in the world.

812
00:42:26,220 --> 00:42:28,820
And with further advances in nanotechnology,

813
00:42:28,920 --> 00:42:32,220
you may someday even have the ultimate bioterrorism

814
00:42:32,320 --> 00:42:35,420
detector hanging beside the smoke detector in your home.

815
00:42:35,421 --> 00:42:39,220
silently screening your error for harmful agents like anthrax,

816
00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:40,720
Ebola, and smallpox.

817
00:42:43,960 --> 00:42:47,860
When the Dark Winter War game was held in June of 2001

818
00:42:47,960 --> 00:42:50,660
to simulate a smallpox attack on America,

819
00:42:50,760 --> 00:42:53,680
the results of the fictional scenario were startling.

820
00:42:53,780 --> 00:42:59,280
Two weeks, mass chaos, 3 million people infected,

821
00:42:59,380 --> 00:43:01,720
1 million dead.

822
00:43:01,820 --> 00:43:05,420
It was made frighteningly clear to the exercise participants

823
00:43:05,421 --> 00:43:07,660
that the country was not prepared to respond

824
00:43:07,760 --> 00:43:10,920
to a major terrorist attack.

825
00:43:11,020 --> 00:43:14,660
Drastic upgrades would be needed in communication, planning,

826
00:43:14,760 --> 00:43:17,160
and technology.

827
00:43:17,260 --> 00:43:19,960
After the terrorist attacks of September 11,

828
00:43:20,060 --> 00:43:23,440
changes have been made, and an urgent push is underway

829
00:43:23,540 --> 00:43:26,400
to develop technologies to protect innocent civilians

830
00:43:26,500 --> 00:43:30,320
from all forms of terrorism.

831
00:43:30,420 --> 00:43:33,640
Smallpox, nerve gas, dirty bombs.

832
00:43:33,641 --> 00:43:35,180
Should we be afraid?

833
00:43:35,280 --> 00:43:37,780
Are we entering a new arms race with an even more

834
00:43:37,880 --> 00:43:39,780
dangerous adversary?

835
00:43:39,880 --> 00:43:42,220
I don't think they have the scientific firepower

836
00:43:42,320 --> 00:43:45,660
to dedicate large teams of researchers

837
00:43:45,760 --> 00:43:49,160
like we're dedicating to combat the problems they're creating.

838
00:43:49,260 --> 00:43:51,800
And so I think we're on different playing fields

839
00:43:51,900 --> 00:43:53,600
in that regard.

840
00:43:53,700 --> 00:43:56,200
Building upon the technologies of the past

841
00:43:56,300 --> 00:43:58,400
and with an eye towards the future,

842
00:43:58,500 --> 00:44:01,900
American scientists are working every day on new ways

843
00:44:01,901 --> 00:44:03,640
to keep civilians safe.

844
00:44:03,740 --> 00:44:05,700
I would not say that I could predict every way

845
00:44:05,800 --> 00:44:08,400
that an individual could choose to do harm to somebody else.

846
00:44:08,500 --> 00:44:11,240
But I am confident that we have many, many tools that we

847
00:44:11,340 --> 00:44:14,480
are bringing to bear to reduce the likelihood that Americans

848
00:44:14,580 --> 00:44:16,520
will become victims of such an attack.

849
00:44:31,900 --> 00:44:39,360
you

850
